stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Reset
    Reset --> Acting: fixed episode seed
    Acting --> Stepping: legal action
    Stepping --> Accumulating: raw reward + flags
    Accumulating --> Acting: no done, cap not reached
    Accumulating --> EnvironmentEnd: terminated or truncated
    Accumulating --> EvaluatorCap: cap reached
    EnvironmentEnd --> Recorded: preserve env flags
    EvaluatorCap --> Recorded: evaluator_truncated=true
    Recorded --> [*]
